[{"answer":"Hello, Wayside Camera Club, Breda speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hello, um, my name's Dan and I'd like to join your club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/2.mp3"},{"answer":"That's great, Dan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/3.mp3"},{"answer":"We have an application form,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/4.mp3"},{"answer":"would you like to complete it over the phone,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/5.mp3"},{"answer":"then you can ask any questions you might have?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/7.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so what's your family name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Green, Dan Green.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/9.mp3"},{"answer":"So, can I take your email address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's dan1068@market.com.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about your home address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm about ten miles away from your club in Peacetown.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I live in a house there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/15.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so what's the house number and street?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 52 Marrowfield Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that M-A-R-R-O-W-F-I-E-L-D?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/18.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/19.mp3"},{"answer":"...and that's Peacetown, you said?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/20.mp3"},{"answer":"So how did you hear about our club?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you look on the internet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I usually do that, but this time...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/23.mp3"},{"answer":"well, I was talking to a relative the other day and he suggested it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, is he a member too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/25.mp3"},{"answer":"He belongs to another club,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/26.mp3"},{"answer":"but he'd heard good things about yours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/27.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So what do you hope to get from joining?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, one thing that really interests me is the competitions that you have.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I enjoy entering those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I also like to socialise with other photographers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/34.mp3"},{"answer":"That's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/35.mp3"},{"answer":"So what type of membership would you like?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/36.mp3"},{"answer":"What are the options?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It's £30 a year for full membership","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/38.mp3"},{"answer":"or £20 a year if you're an associate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'll go for the full membership, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/40.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a good idea","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/41.mp3"},{"answer":"because you can't vote in meetings with an associate membership.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/42.mp3"},{"answer":"If I could just find out a bit more about you...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/43.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/44.mp3"},{"answer":"So you said you wanted to compete,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/45.mp3"},{"answer":"have you ever won any photography competitions?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Not yet, but I have entered three in the past.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So why don't you tell me something about those?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's start with the first one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the theme was entitled 'Domestic Life'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/52.mp3"},{"answer":"So it had to be something related to the home?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I chose to take a photo of a family sitting round the dinner table having a meal,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/55.mp3"},{"answer":"and, urn, I didn't win, but I did get some feedback.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, what did the judges say?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/57.mp3"},{"answer":"That it was too 'busy' as a picture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Aha, so it was the composition of the picture that they criticised?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/59.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right, and once they'd told me that, I could see my mistake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/60.mp3"},{"answer":"So what was the theme of the second composition?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, my university was on the coast","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and that area gets a lot of beautiful sunsets","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/63.mp3"},{"answer":"so that was the theme.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, sunsets, that's a great theme.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/66.mp3"},{"answer":"The instructions were to capture the clouds as well,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/67.mp3"},{"answer":"it couldn't just be blue sky and a setting sun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, 'cause they give you all those amazing pinks and purples.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and I thought I'd done that well,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/70.mp3"},{"answer":"but the feedback was that I should have waited a bit longer to get the shot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/72.mp3"},{"answer":"So the timing wasn't right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I took it too soon, basically.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/74.mp3"},{"answer":"And then the third competition I entered was called 'Animal Magic'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's a difficult subject!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I know!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I had to take hundreds of shots.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure, because animals move all the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/79-2024-10-26-17-56-45.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what we had to show,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/80.mp3"},{"answer":"there had to be some movements in the scene.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/81.mp3"},{"answer":"I got a great shot of a fox in the end,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/82.mp3"},{"answer":"but I took it at night and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/83.mp3"},{"answer":"well, I suspected that it was a bit dark which is what I was told.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, Dan, you seem to be really keen and we'd be delighted to have you in our club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/85.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure we can help with all those areas that you've outlined.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, that's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-3-part-1-2023-06-17-11-12-53/87.mp3"}]
